Modifications
================================================================================

Modifications and the Pi adaptation: Copyright (c) 2026 KapsCa, MIT.

What belongs to the upstreams: the scanning workflow, the report structure and
the triage rules inherited from cdmx-in/security-review, plus the false-positive
rulebook taken from anthropics/claude-code-security-review.

What is ours: the Phase 11 rule that every testable finding graduates to a
permanent invariant test, the [OVERRIDE] against the upstream false-positive
rulebook for rate limiting and missing transport security, the adaptation to the
Pi skill format, and the versioning from 1.0.0 to 1.2.0-pi.5.

Neither upstream endorses or maintains this adaptation. Report defects here, not
to them.
